{"id":"aa25b0fd9e2cf41e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-weighted-tour-language.md","title":"带权旅行商判定语言","display":"df-weighted-tour-language — 带权旅行商判定语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-weighted-tour-language","aliases":["73-df-weighted-tour-language"],"display":"df-weighted-tour-language — 带权旅行商判定语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.1.4 and §10.4.5, print pp. 430–431, 471–473; PDF pp. 452–453, 493–495; explicit binary weights","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-weighted-tour-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-weighted-tour-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weighted-tour-language — 带权旅行商判定语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f6d4d247465f3c9\" href=\"?note=4f6d4d247465f3c9\" title=\"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding\">73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.1.4 and §10.4.5, print pp. 430–431, 471–473; PDF pp. 452–453, 493–495; explicit binary weights"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(K\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W:V_n^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(W:V_n^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in V_n\\;W(i,i)=0\">\\(\\forall i\\in V_n\\;W(i,i)=0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j\\in V_n\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow W(i,j)=W(j,i)\\ge1)\">\\(\\forall i,j\\in V_n\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow W(i,j)=W(j,i)\\ge1)\\)</span>。编码在下式定义；全部权值以二进制自定界表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W,K)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,K\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle W(\\lfloor h/n\\rfloor,h\\bmod n):0\\le h&lt;n^2\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W,K)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,K\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle W(\\lfloor h/n\\rfloor,h\\bmod n):0\\le h&lt;n^2\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TSP}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W,K):\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3},\\ K\\in\\mathbb N,\\ W:V_n^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\ (\\forall i\\in V_n\\;W(i,i)=0),\\\n(\\forall i,j\\in V_n\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow W(i,j)=W(j,i)\\ge1)),\\\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}W(\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n))\\le K\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TSP}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W,K):\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3},\\ K\\in\\mathbb N,\\ W:V_n^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\ (\\forall i\\in V_n\\;W(i,i)=0),\\\n(\\forall i,j\\in V_n\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow W(i,j)=W(j,i)\\ge1)),\\\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}W(\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n))\\le K\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里是完整无向正权图上的判定版 TSP，不是寻找最优巡回的输出问题。二进制权值避免用一元权重把伪多项式算法混成多项式算法；无效长度、非对称矩阵等输入拒绝。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","status":"resolved","id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W:V_n^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in V_n\\;W(i,i)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i,j\\in V_n\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow W(i,j)=W(j,i)\\ge1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W,K)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,K\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle W(\\lfloor h/n\\rfloor,h\\bmod n):0\\le h<n^2\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TSP}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{TWCode}(n,W,K):\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3},\\ K\\in\\mathbb N,\\ W:V_n^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\ (\\forall i\\in V_n\\;W(i,i)=0),\\\n(\\forall i,j\\in V_n\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow W(i,j)=W(j,i)\\ge1)),\\\n\\exists\\pi:V_n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V_n\\;\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}W(\\pi(i),\\pi((i+1)\\bmod n))\\le K\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1787,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-weighted-tour-language|带权旅行商判定语言]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"853911eb6042f48c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["bc88ca69b33d5036","4f6d4d247465f3c9"]}